# Wawona Terminal host (libghostty-rs + UniFFI)

**Product crate:** `github.com/Wawona/Terminal` (flake `terminal`).

**Product grid** = Rust **libghostty-rs** (`libghostty-vt`) behind UniFFI
(`GhosttySurface` / `TerminalSession`). Native UI paints only. Shell
backends: `wawona-terminal-shell-backend` / `domain::terminal_shell`.

## Hard rejects

- GhosttyKit as a product input
- Product `.dylib` on Apple-mobile
- Homemade VT branded as libghostty
- Hardcoded `/bin/zsh` instead of the shell resolver
- Vision Pro dogfood for Terminal when the task is macOS
- New Zig `ghostty_surface_*` product work (`Wawona/Ghostty` archived)

Credits: Ghostty MIT; libghostty-rs; Rootshell MIT UX ideas only.

